--- A ClickHouse server that does not answer stops the program as the
--- connection opens, with the driver's reason, the same in both modes. A
--- compiled program that used ClickHouse without the web layer had not
--- built: the driver's tokio lacked the features it uses.
use db
ch = connect['clickhouse://default@127.0.0.1:1/none']
log[query[ch, 'SELECT 1 AS one']]
